<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xml:lang="ja" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v2"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Kimigaite Mizuninaru"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="ZUTOMAYO"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Tadashii Itsuwarikarano Kishou - EP"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="JPPO01805182"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1440134065"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translations><translation xml:lang="zh-Hans" type="subtitle"><text for="L1">漫溢开来的淡淡绀蓝 一直以来</text><text for="L2">没给我们的时光一个定论 只是拂去身上的沙砾</text><text for="L3">如何去思考怎样去领会 我也一无所知</text><text for="L4">想要借清晨尝下的忧愁 让记忆就此沉睡</text><text for="L5">究竟是该去往某处 还是驻留的勇气</text><text for="L6">正面临着考验 想要借由怀疑去相信</text><text for="L7">若连乐音也归于沉寂 我便不会起舞</text><text for="L8">那借来未还的半弦月 也终于能够放手释怀</text><text for="L9">只凭那份气息就能跨越过去</text><text for="L10">世俗羁绊与秩序里的任性 因你的存在而化成了水</text><text for="L11">只是一味追寻着毫无色彩的光芒</text><text for="L12">愿这忍不住在意的距离 仅由我一人独自挂怀</text><text for="L13">小舟顺水漂流 只向着卸下力气的微光之处</text><text for="L14">对着鲜艳的水果吐露恶言</text><text for="L15">夹杂着刚学会的谎言</text><text for="L16">靠着将这一切吃尽 勉强支撑着站立</text><text for="L17">若不保持那个满口怪话的我</text><text for="L18">就会陷入永无交集的同类之中</text><text for="L19">避开你的视线 剜痛伤口</text><text for="L20">以磨损耗尽的心放声歌唱</text><text for="L21">若是你能展颜欢笑 我也会试着笑一笑</text><text for="L22">只凭那份气息就能跨越过去</text><text for="L23">世俗羁绊与秩序里的任性 因你的存在而化成了水</text><text for="L24">只是一味追寻着毫无色彩的光芒</text><text for="L25">愿这忍不住在意的距离 仅由我一人独自挂怀</text><text for="L26">小舟顺水漂流 只向着卸下力气的微光之处</text><text for="L27">黑醋栗色的长发轻轻摇曳</text><text for="L28">哭泣到喉咙干渴 至今仍是如此</text><text for="L29">关于你的事 让我讲讲这半途之中的过往吧</text><text for="L30">究竟是得到了谁与何物的许可 才能这般活着</text><text for="L31">心中的感情 真的有必要赋予名字吗</text><text for="L32">啊啊 无法言断 如今依旧只能这般悬而未决</text><text for="L33">只是在亦步亦趋吗</text><text for="L34">未曾挑明 依然无法明了 啊</text><text for="L35">哪怕只是些光鲜亮丽的辞藻也好</text><text for="L36">哪怕稍稍触碰到的瞬间 便无法仅止于憧憬</text><text for="L37">只是一味追寻着毫无色彩的光芒</text><text for="L38">愿这首暗自探寻的歌 永远不会传达至你耳畔</text><text for="L39">小舟顺水漂流 只向着卸下力气的微光之处</text></translation></translations><songwriters><songwriter>ACAne</songwriter></songwriters></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="4:13.146"><div begin="0:29.236" end="4:13.146"><p begin="0:29.236" end="0:33.476" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:29.236" end="0:29.376">は</span><span begin="0:29.376" end="0:29.726">み</span><span begin="0:29.726" end="0:29.976">出</span><span begin="0:29.976" end="0:30.086">し</span><span begin="0:30.086" end="0:30.216">て</span><span begin="0:30.216" end="0:30.636">た</span> <span begin="0:30.976" end="0:31.416">淡い</span><span begin="0:31.416" end="0:31.946">紺</span><span begin="0:31.946" end="0:32.286">色</span><span begin="0:32.286" end="0:32.526">が</span><span begin="0:32.526" end="0:32.906">ずっ</span><span begin="0:32.906" end="0:33.476">と</span></p><p begin="0:34.166" end="0:40.816" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:34.166" end="0:34.596">僕</span><span begin="0:34.596" end="0:34.726">ら</span><span begin="0:34.726" end="0:34.946">の</span><span begin="0:34.946" end="0:35.086">時</span><span begin="0:35.086" end="0:35.576">間</span><span begin="0:35.576" end="0:35.756">を</span><span begin="0:35.756" end="0:36.166">解</span><span begin="0:36.166" end="0:37.006">決</span><span begin="0:37.366" end="0:37.526">さ</span><span begin="0:37.526" end="0:37.796">せ</span><span begin="0:37.796" end="0:37.946">ず</span><span begin="0:37.946" end="0:38.166">に</span> <span begin="0:38.166" end="0:38.606">砂</span><span begin="0:38.606" end="0:38.726">を</span><span begin="0:38.726" end="0:39.386">払っ</span><span begin="0:39.386" end="0:40.246">た</span><span begin="0:40.246" end="0:40.346">り</span><span begin="0:40.346" end="0:40.476">し</span><span begin="0:40.476" end="0:40.816">た</sp